  "notesAndLimitations": [
    "The manual uses 'Polyline' generically in tables; this JSON represents it as LWPOLYLINE except where the manual expressly says Open Polyline.",
    "Several table rows contain multiple colors or descriptions. Where the table lists distinct color values in the same row, the grouped entry uses null and records the color variants in its name or notes; confirm before enforcing these grouped rows in an automated checker.",
    "Manual text extraction retains printed spellings such as DIARIES, STAIDA and PLACE OF WORKSHIP; these have not been silently corrected.",
    "Section 4.0 is authoritative for color/type/layer combinations; Annexure 17.1–17.3 provides visual examples and may add contextual detail."
  ]
